<title>POLAND: KRUSZWICA REVISES UP 1996 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>KRUSZWICA REVISES UP 1996 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kruszwica SA results for the</p>
<p>financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			30.96 vs    58.09</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  11.88 vs    30.32</p>
<p>    net profit				 7.07 vs    15.81</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklady Tluszczowe Kruszwica</p>
<p>SA. Earlier the company reported a net profit of 3.4 million</p>
<p>zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales				475.44 vs   543.21</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 387.87 vs   440.25</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.14 vs     0.18</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.63 vs    14.37</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     3.58 vs     3.56</p>
<p>    financial costs			 22.53 vs    31.15</p>
<p>    investment				40.00 vs    25.41</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
